cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Cloud VPS prices by city: Vultr, DigitalOcean, Linode and Hetzner"
authors:
  - name: "Neckrez"
    website: "https://neckrez.tech"
version: "2026.11.25"
date-released: "2026-11-25"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sauberr/cloud-vps-prices-by-city"
url: "https://neckrez.tech/data/cloud-vps-prices"
abstract: >-
  Public list prices of cloud VPS plans on Vultr, DigitalOcean, Linode and Hetzner,
  one row per plan and city, collected from each provider's own API, with a summary
  that compares the same shared-CPU sizes across providers. Prices are in US dollars
  without VAT; Hetzner's separately billed IPv4 is added so every price includes one
  public IPv4.
keywords:
  - cloud computing
  - VPS
  - pricing
  - Vultr
  - DigitalOcean
  - Linode
  - Akamai
  - Hetzner
